{
    "title": "Tinder Dating App: Chat & Date",
    "description": "<b>MATCH, CHAT & DATE. IT STARTS WITH A SWIPE\u2122.</b>\r\n\r\nWith 97+ billion matches to date, Tinder\u00ae is the top free dating app and the best place to meet new people, with leading safety features to date more safely. Looking for love? A relationship? Trying to find a date or make new friends? Connect with people globally on Tinder and enhance your dating experience:\r\n\r\nCome As You Are: Whether you're straight, gay, bisexual, or anything in between, you can be who you are and find who you want.\r\nDate Beyond Photos: Share interests and discover more about your matches to start conversations.\r\nSeek What You\u2019re Looking For: Set relationship goals and date on your terms.\r\n\r\n<b>HOW TINDER WORKS</b>\r\nFinding new people and dating on Tinder\u00ae can be easy and fun. Make your personality shine in your profile to stand out. Answer prompts, share about yourself, and show your face in pics to increase match potential. Use Swipe Right\u2122 feature to Like and Swipe Left\u2122 feature to Nope. If they Like you back, It\u2019s a Match! Our double opt-in feature ensures mutual interest for every match.\r\n\r\n<b>PUT SAFETY FIRST</b>\r\nTry our safety features for safer dating: \r\n\r\n- Share My Date: Inform friends and family about your date plans \u2014 who you\u2019ll meet up with and where\r\n- Get Photo Verified: Verify your photos to confirm it\u2019s really you in that cute pic and increase your matching chances\r\n- Are You Sure / Does This Bother You: Detects inappropriate language to keep messages respectful\r\n- Report a Profile: Quickly report / block suspicious or inappropriate profiles\r\n- Block Contacts: Take control and block anyone (like an ex) you don\u2019t want to see on this dating app\r\n- Video Chat: Hitting it off in chat? Test your online dating chemistry and meet new people from home!\r\n\r\n<b>TRY TINDER PLUS</b>\r\n- Unlimited Likes: Catch feelings for as many new dates as you want\r\n- Passport Mode\u2122: Match and chat with locals anywhere in the world before you arrive\r\n- Unlimited Rewinds: Undo your last Like or Nope to control your dating choices\r\n- Go Incognito: Be seen only by the people you Like\r\n\r\n<b>EXPERIENCE TINDER GOLD</b>\r\n- Get everything in Tinder Plus\u2122 \r\n- Try for a week before committing to a monthly subscription \u2014 ideal for dating and meeting new people\r\n- See who Likes You to match instantly for quicker connections, making dating more exciting\r\n- Monthly Boost puts your profile at the top for 30 minutes to increase profile views\r\n- Weekly Super Likes, because sometimes you really, really Like someone\r\n\r\n<b>UPGRADE TO TINDER PLATINUM</b>\r\nGet most of Tinder\u2019s premium features: Join Tinder Platinum\u2122 to prioritize your Likes with potential matches, send a compliment before matching, and more dating perks.\r\n\r\nSo what are you waiting for? Tinder offers safety dating features to meet new people and make friends confidently. Join millions of people worldwide to increase your chances of finding exactly what you're looking for. Download our free dating app today!\r\n\r\n---------------\r\nIf you choose to purchase Tinder Plus\u00ae, Tinder Gold\u2122 or Tinder Platinum\u2122 payment will be charged to your Google Play account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in the Play Store after purchase. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period. If you don\u2019t choose to purchase Tinder Plus\u00ae, Tinder Gold\u2122 or Tinder Platinum\u2122, you can simply continue using Tinder for free.\r\n\r\nAll photos are of models and used for illustrative purposes only.\r\n\r\nPrivacy: https://www.gotinder.com/privacy\r\nTerms: https://www.gotinder.com/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>MATCH, CHAT &amp; DATE. IT STARTS WITH A SWIPE\u2122.</b><br><br>With 97+ billion matches to date, Tinder\u00ae is the top free dating app and the best place to meet new people, with leading safety features to date more safely. Looking for love? A relationship? Trying to find a date or make new friends? Connect with people globally on Tinder and enhance your dating experience:<br><br>Come As You Are: Whether you&#39;re straight, gay, bisexual, or anything in between, you can be who you are and find who you want.<br>Date Beyond Photos: Share interests and discover more about your matches to start conversations.<br>Seek What You\u2019re Looking For: Set relationship goals and date on your terms.<br><br><b>HOW TINDER WORKS</b><br>Finding new people and dating on Tinder\u00ae can be easy and fun. Make your personality shine in your profile to stand out. Answer prompts, share about yourself, and show your face in pics to increase match potential. Use Swipe Right\u2122 feature to Like and Swipe Left\u2122 feature to Nope. If they Like you back, It\u2019s a Match! Our double opt-in feature ensures mutual interest for every match.<br><br><b>PUT SAFETY FIRST</b><br>Try our safety features for safer dating: <br><br>- Share My Date: Inform friends and family about your date plans \u2014 who you\u2019ll meet up with and where<br>- Get Photo Verified: Verify your photos to confirm it\u2019s really you in that cute pic and increase your matching chances<br>- Are You Sure / Does This Bother You: Detects inappropriate language to keep messages respectful<br>- Report a Profile: Quickly report / block suspicious or inappropriate profiles<br>- Block Contacts: Take control and block anyone (like an ex) you don\u2019t want to see on this dating app<br>- Video Chat: Hitting it off in chat? Test your online dating chemistry and meet new people from home!<br><br><b>TRY TINDER PLUS</b><br>- Unlimited Likes: Catch feelings for as many new dates as you want<br>- Passport Mode\u2122: Match and chat with locals anywhere in the world before you arrive<br>- Unlimited Rewinds: Undo your last Like or Nope to control your dating choices<br>- Go Incognito: Be seen only by the people you Like<br><br><b>EXPERIENCE TINDER GOLD</b><br>- Get everything in Tinder Plus\u2122 <br>- Try for a week before committing to a monthly subscription \u2014 ideal for dating and meeting new people<br>- See who Likes You to match instantly for quicker connections, making dating more exciting<br>- Monthly Boost puts your profile at the top for 30 minutes to increase profile views<br>- Weekly Super Likes, because sometimes you really, really Like someone<br><br><b>UPGRADE TO TINDER PLATINUM</b><br>Get most of Tinder\u2019s premium features: Join Tinder Platinum\u2122 to prioritize your Likes with potential matches, send a compliment before matching, and more dating perks.<br><br>So what are you waiting for? Tinder offers safety dating features to meet new people and make friends confidently. Join millions of people worldwide to increase your chances of finding exactly what you&#39;re looking for. Download our free dating app today!<br><br>---------------<br>If you choose to purchase Tinder Plus\u00ae, Tinder Gold\u2122 or Tinder Platinum\u2122 payment will be charged to your Google Play account, and your account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time by going to your settings in the Play Store after purchase. No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period. If you don\u2019t choose to purchase Tinder Plus\u00ae, Tinder Gold\u2122 or Tinder Platinum\u2122, you can simply continue using Tinder for free.<br><br>All photos are of models and used for illustrative purposes only.<br><br>Privacy: https://www.gotinder.com/privacy<br>Terms: https://www.gotinder.com/terms",
